Prometheus `v2.49.1` is producing the metadata information in the following format
```
export interface PromMetricsMetadataItem {
  type: string;
  help: string;
  unit?: string;
}
```

But Prometheus `v2.50.0` seems to change that to 

ta information in the following format
```
export interface PromMetricsMetadataItem {
  Type: string;
  Help: string;
  Unit?: string;
}
```

so when we try to get `type` we get nothing basically. I keep digging.
